      re-export and the JSX comment. The verifier's nine seed files were re-created under
      external-spa/src/zzseed. The production fact went red with 8 violations, one per shape (F was caught via
      F_reexport.ts). The seeds were then deleted. P1 was re-run against the new detector: red at
      GridWidgetBody.tsx:71, then restored (no diff) and touched.
      Item 10 (comment stripper failed open): only comments that START their line are stripped now, so a "/*" or
